{:edb/db-before-t 1043 :edb/db-after-t 1044 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534356 50 #inst "2026-10-11T19:34:48.531Z" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117506 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117507 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117508 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117509 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117510 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420147 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420148 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420149 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420150 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420151 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186117505 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420148 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186119830 1038 #edb/ref 17592186420153 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186120224 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186120224 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $Q(2,-3, 5)$ and is perpendicular to the line that goes through the points\n$A(3, 2,-8)$ and $B(1, 2,-5)$." 13194139534356 17592186045417 false] [17592186120224 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $Q(2,-3,5)$ and is perpendicular to the line that goes through the points \n$A(3,2,-8)$ and $B(1,2,-5).$" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186120224 1074 "First, we note that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=⟨2,-3,5⟩.$\n\nSince the line  passes through the points $A(3,2,-8)$ and $B(1,2,-5)$, we can find a vector that is parallel to the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨1,2,-5⟩-⟨3,2,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,0,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-2,0,3⟩.$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-2,0,3⟩ & =⟨2,-3,5⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,0,3⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-2,0,3⟩ & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1043 #edb/ref 17592186420154 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1043 #edb/ref 17592186420155 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1043 #edb/ref 17592186420156 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1043 #edb/ref 17592186420157 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1043 #edb/ref 17592186420158 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1045 "The Vector Equation of a Plane" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1046 #edb/ref 17592186420157 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049436 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420141 1053 #uuid "77095dee-04b2-5198-bba9-43f589fc9964" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420142 1080 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420142 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420142 1083 #uuid "1b182a09-cc9d-51c4-95fe-e78790ecf72a" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420143 1080 "3" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420143 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420143 1083 #uuid "36cb63bc-ae79-51e4-b5ab-3039c42340e0" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420144 1080 "\\frac{5}{3}" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420144 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420144 1083 #uuid "4173b538-e381-5dd5-b0c5-10dc2eaa96c4" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [1759218642014