17592186420144 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420145 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420146 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1077 "selection" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420143 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420152 1079 #uuid "f9a0d8dd-871f-5fc8-9699-7a78c5f80aac" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420152 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1069 "q-127921" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1071 "A nonzero vector $⟨0,\\,b,\\,c⟩$ is parallel to the plane $r\\cdot ⟨5,-1,3⟩=27.$ What is the value of $\\frac{b}{c}?$" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1072 #uuid "3fa29ff6-5ae4-5642-82fd-03b1645e810c" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420153 1074 "We need a vector $v=⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩$ that is parallel to the given plane. \n\nFrom the equation $r\\cdot ⟨5,-1,3⟩=27$ of the plane, we get the normal vector $n=⟨5,-1,3⟩.$ So, $v⊥n$ and we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩\\cdot ⟨5,-1,3⟩ & =0 \\\\ 5{t}_{1}-{t}_{2}+3{t}_{3} & =0 \\\\ {t}_{2} & =5{t}_{1}+3{t}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain \n\n$$\nv=⟨{t}_{1},\\,5{t}_{1}+3{t}_{3},\\,{t}_{3}⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${t}_{1},{t}_{3}\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nWe are told that the first component of $v$ equals $0.$ So, we must set ${t}_{1}=0.$ \n\nSince $v$ is nonzero, we can pick any ${t}_{3}\\ne 0.$ For example, setting ${t}_{3}=1$, we get\n\n$$\nv=⟨0,\\,3,\\,1⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{b}{c}=3.$" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420154 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420155 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420154 1062 #uuid "6262b847-bfad-5541-b7d9-0c48d99eb024" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420154 1063 #edb/ref 17592186393043 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420155 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420156 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420155 1062 #uuid "6f1edd60-137c-5af0-bf08-f3f3e9df0344" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420155 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262846 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420156 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420158 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420156 1062 #uuid "7c175861-cf16-5bce-9a3d-7dd7700bfeb3" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420156 1063 #edb/ref 17592186420153 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420157 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420154 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420157 1062 #uuid "8d1b2442-6684-5f23-a6d5-881beb105644" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420157 1063 #edb/ref 17592186120224 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420158 1062 #uuid "f1fe54dc-0b25-528c-81fb-caa7a89e418f" 13194139534356 17592186045417 true] [17592186420158 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262859 13194139534356 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-77095dee-04b2-5198-bba9-43f589fc9964" 17592186420141 "answer-1b182a09-cc9d-51c4-95fe-e78790ecf72a" 17592186420142 "answer-36cb63bc-ae79-51e4-b5ab-3039c42340e0" 17592186420143 "answer-4173b538-e381-5dd5-b0c5-10dc2eaa96c4" 17592186420144 "answer-502b671f-b1be-5d29-8f96-08571a87d173" 17592186420145 "answer-72001519-6957-56f0-b511-f27a9ed3c85f" 17592186420146 "answer-7a8f836e-b1bd-5929-a0d4-cc62e2406547" 17592186420147 "answer-8f5b6228-4151-5fb7-a8b8-4defb3112da4" 17592186420148 "answer-ab54b251-064b-57d4-8fc1-3a45c6f498e7" 17592186420149 "answer-b05ca4a9-4343-56a3-86ae-980793c8602f" 17592186420150 "answer-f59eba3d-6e2f-504f-905a-a227d63c2c42" 17592186420151 "answer-field-f9a0d8dd-871f-5fc8-9699-7a78c5f80aac" 17592186420152 "question-3fa29ff6-5ae4-5642-82fd-03b1645e810c" 17592186420153 "step-6262b847-bfad-5541-b7d9-0c48d99eb024" 17592186420